'15 minutes: show the profit effect of the three items, calculate corrected profit and write one close-review note.',
['Electricity: profit adjustment INR','Software: profit adjustment INR','Advance: profit adjustment INR'],'State corrected profit and the reason for the largest adjustment in 40 words.',
'The close-room challenge',['Preparer: calculate adjustments','Reviewer: challenge timing','Manager: protect the deadline','Auditor: demand support'],
